const settings = window.__AETHERIA_SETTINGS__;
if(settings) settings.lang = id;
saveSettings(settings ?? {});
```
But in menu openSettings, `window.__AETHERIA_SETTINGS__` set in main. Good. In in-game settings, same ref. Then `onLanguage` saveSettings(settings) also. Good.
